Your strikes are imbued with a vile power that extends your victim's suffering. When hitting in melee, you have a ([15%, 27%, 36%, 44%, 50% (TL1-5)]) chance to extend the length of all negative effects and reduce the length of all positive effects on the target by [1, 1, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] turn(s).

This can only trigger on any particular target once every 6 turns.
